<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.25 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.25 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.25 percent in the week ending September 14 from 6.02 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Sep 14, 1996  Sep 7, 1996  Sep 16, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.25	  +6.02	   +8.93</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  316.2	  315.4	   297.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended September 16, 1995.</p>
</text>
